# 2026-09-05 00:26:20.667978
+Implement Feature SC-06 (As-Built BOQ Reconciliation & Waste Ledger):
+
+1. In `src/utils/scopeReconciliation.ts`:
+   Export function `calculateBoqWasteLedger(params: {
+     boqItemId: string;
+     contractualWasteAllowancePercent: number;
+     purchasedQty: number;
+     certifiedInstalledQty: number;
+     unitRate: number;
+   })`:
+   - Calculate `wasteQty = purchasedQty - certifiedInstalledQty`.
+   - Calculate `wastePercentage = purchasedQty > 0 ? (wasteQty / purchasedQty) * 100 : 0`.
+   - Calculate `wasteCost = wasteQty * unitRate`.
+   - Set `isExcessiveWaste = wastePercentage > contractualWasteAllowancePercent`.
+   - Return an object containing: `{ boqItemId, purchasedQty, certifiedInstalledQty, wasteQty, wastePercentage, wasteCost, isExcessiveWaste }`.
+
+2. In `tests/scope-reconciliation.test.mjs`:
+   Write unit tests using `node:test` and `node:assert`:
+   - Test 1: Normal waste within allowance (purchased 100, certified 95, allowance 7% -> waste 5%, isExcessiveWaste = false).
+   - Test 2: Excessive waste exceeding allowance (purchased 100, certified 88, allowance 5% -> waste 12%, isExcessiveWaste = true, wasteCost correctly computed).
+   - Test 3: Zero purchased edge-case (returns zero waste without dividing by zero).
+
+Do not create any UI components. Only logic and test files.

